Date: Fri, 27 Nov 2026 15:28:26 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] test(shader): keep Belobug PR #142's BVH prefix cases

No code is ported: our read_lane_across/first_lane_across handling and the
per-operand lane-uniform checks already translate both forms, so the two cases
are kept as regression coverage. The wave-alike prefix scan lowers with
WaveSize(32); the lane-dependent-address form is refused with "a first-lane
read of a value that may differ between 32-lane halves". The harness helper
for a 32-lane host is now shared by both programs.

Ported from paveledits/ScarlettMac runtime-preview/checkpoint/patches/0006-test-shader-keep-Belobug-PR-142-s-BVH-prefix-cases.patch

